[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14823.83, "timestamp": "04:07:03", "text": "就是那种混合吸入器​​，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14829.03, "timestamp": "04:07:09", "text": "是的。它可能会让人上瘾。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14832.389, "timestamp": "04:07:12", "text": "很多人都这样做。呃，我通常会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14835.03, "timestamp": "04:07:15", "text": "就像当“不”这个词太刺耳的时候一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14838.63, "timestamp": "04:07:18", "text": "稀的。是的，确实如此。比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14841.99, "timestamp": "04:07:21", "text": "我的朋友们，我的意思是所有的朋友，都会是朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14844.15, "timestamp": "04:07:24", "text": "就像我爷爷以前也会做的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14846.309, "timestamp": "04:07:26", "text": "他会注意到我经常打喷嚏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14849.51, "timestamp": "04:07:29", "text": "打喷嚏的时候感觉不到冷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14853.03, "timestamp": "04:07:33", "text": "更像是过敏反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14854.87, "timestamp": "04:07:34", "text": "过敏。所以他会说，“是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14857.91, "timestamp": "04:07:37", "text": "吸一口气。”然后我就想，“好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14864.469, "timestamp": "04:07:44", "text": "我现在头疼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14866.55, "timestamp": "04:07:46", "text": "可能是温度变化。”哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14876.71, "timestamp": "04:07:56", "text": "回归。是的。对我来说，嗯，我以前"}]